---
---

<div class="space-y-10">
  <!-- Page Header (Light Warm Theme) -->
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-[#0032A0] text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border border-blue-200 shadow-xs">
      Official Ordinance Repository
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
      Browse Ordinances & Categories
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
      Select a category below or type keywords to filter city ordinances. Click any ordinance title or details button to open its full page, or view the official PDF directly.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Educational Section: What is a Regulatory Ordinance? (Decorated with ZC.svg Seal & Vinta Ribbon) -->
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs space-y-6">
    {/* Vinta Flag 4-Color Top Ribbon */}
    <div class="h-2.5 w-full flex">
      <div class="flex-1 bg-[#0032A0]"></div>
      <div class="flex-1 bg-[#1A9714]"></div>
      <div class="flex-1 bg-[#F6CD18]"></div>
      <div class="flex-1 bg-[#B32435]"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 pt-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <!-- Official Zamboanga City Vinta SVG Seal -->
          <img 
            src="/images/ZC.svg" 
            alt="Zamboanga City Seal & Vinta" 
            class="w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 shrink-0 object-contain drop-shadow-xs" 
          />

          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-[#0032A0] uppercase tracking-wider">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#0032A0]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
              Understanding Zamboanga City Laws
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
              What is a Regulatory Ordinance?
            </h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 rounded-lg border border-amber-200/80 self-start md:self-auto shrink-0">
          Sangguniang Panlungsod Legislation
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">
        A <strong>Regulatory Ordinance</strong> is an official local law enacted by the City Council (<span class="text-[#0032A0] font-bold">Sangguniang Panlungsod</span>) of Zamboanga City to regulate specific activities, safeguard public health, protect the environment, maintain public order, and ensure safety across all 98 barangays.
      </p>

      <!-- 3 Key Pillars -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
        <div class="bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/80 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 text-[#0032A0] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Legal Authority</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Passed under the Local Government Code of 1991 (R.A. 7160), giving Zamboanga City police power to enforce laws.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/80 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Public Welfare</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Covers single-use plastic bans, commercial CCTV rules, zero open defecation, and no-smoking zones.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Penalties & Fines</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Establishes tiered administrative fines, community service, or business permit revocations for violations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
